[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ARI-003
VERSION: 1
TITLE: Multiplication
STATEMENT: >>>
When the service receives a valid multiplication request, the service
**shall** return the exact product `a × b`.
<<<
KIND: functional
STATUS: draft
PRIORITY: high
SAFETY: QM
RELEASE: 1.0.0
VERIFICATION: test
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
TAGS: arithmetic, multiplication
SOURCE: Stakeholder request, 2026-11-18
OWNER: msforenter090
CREATED: 2026-11-18T00:00:00Z
RATIONALE: >>>
The product of two decimal numbers always has a finite decimal form, so it
can be returned without rounding.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
- Exact means: no digit is lost or rounded, for operands of any length
  allowed by REQ-VAL-001. The product of two 1000-character operands has
  at most 2000 digits.
<<<
